# Stray output directory name — the script that used to build here (`npm run
# hub`) is gone, so nothing generates this any more, but it is cheap defensive
# cover against exactly the failure mode it just caught: a leftover local
# build almost got committed as tracked files when this line was removed
# during the client-hub removal PR.
/public-clients/

# Vercel CLI link state
.vercel/

# Wrangler local state — miniflare's emulated KV/D1/R2/cache, written by
# `npm run cf:dev`. Machine-local scratch, and it is SQLite, so committing it
# would churn binary diffs on every local run.
.wrangler/

# Claude Code (machine-local)
.claude/settings.local.json
Claude Outputs/
